{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"nets\":{\"big\":\"Y\",\"small\":\"Y\",\"core\":\"Y\",\"concise\":\"Y\",\"human\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\",\"load\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"big：Y 的大字把每屏的因果和当下心境交代得更完整，整曲的心理变化也更容易串起来；small：Y 的小字更常补充当屏的情绪和听感转折，X 有几处只是把大字的舍不得、空落和想哭再说一遍；core：Y 更持续地把亲密的幸福与留不住它的痛楚放在一起。concise：X 的没开口、收住、留话没说等意思跨屏回返较多，Y 的回环更像状态推进；human：X 略胜，Y 的「你已经听见时间正在经过」「不安还没回答」「悬置的期待」「放到开阔的尺度」存在视角跳变、搭配生硬或书面摘要腔。fine：X 的感受更多落在话到嘴边、手不自觉收紧、独处泛酸等具体的人身体验，Y 有不少小字转去描述左手、声线和旋律；load：X 的大块虽然数量较多，但单块较短且按意群分批出现，Y 的整句大块偏长，尤其部分屏幕需要连续读较长的句子才能抓住重点。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "831bbada-bad2-4c38-a77c-d321ed193683", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T044857830365Z", "elapsed_seconds": 222.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T04:52:40.701635+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "81be2a1057f80e26fd67d87cc51e50f83f35f4f4ab3de85c82110b196a88c202", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3e